  "retainedOriginalCapture": {
    "path": ".local/original-http.json",
    "sha256": "74cc460f251e87000ed5becc18fba7d2a12034d0dc01a0fef5d3f0f4ec27b1ff",
    "verification": "All original Search header names and noncredential values plus body checked against retained original CDP events. No credential values exported."
  },
  "substitutions": [
    "Inert standard fetch provider captures options and never resolves; no network.",
    "Module 74960 setter interfaces assign original builder values; platform/version inputs are original actual capture values.",
    "Original Desktop TokenProvider registration, provider and AccessTokenClient methods execute unchanged. Inert Esperanto supplies a synthetic decoded native token response; response protobuf decoding is a boundary substitution. Original request codecs emit empty getToken/onTokenCleared payloads; a standard empty protobuf writer has no field-writing capability.",
    "Credential sentinels replace redacted authorization/client-token. Dynamic body/locale/length come from executed original factories."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Original CDP provides decoded fields, not HTTP header order, HPACK/QPACK, frames, TLS or QUIC.",
    "Browser-generated profile is the retained Spotify 1.3.6.1921 macOS Search profile; other browser/build profiles are not inferred.",
    "Native client-token insertion is observed in original ExtraInfo; this oracle consumes an explicit token and does not execute its acquisition/interception owner."
  ],
